{
  "id": "tree-hole",
  "name": "note",
  "category": "树洞留言",
  "description": "一条匿名树洞留言",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "random",
    "probability": 0.015,
    "conditions": []
  },
  "variables": {
    "content": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 250,
      "description": "树洞留言内容，应该是真心话或秘密"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "date",
      "description": "留言日期"
    },
    "mood": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "情感",
      "options": [
        "倾诉",
        "困惑",
        "幸福",
        "痛苦",
        "释然"
      ],
      "default": "倾诉"
    },
    "anonymous": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "匿名标识或'无名氏'"
    }
  },
  "promptTemplate": "请生成一张「note」的内容。\n\n背景信息：\n- 当前场景：{{scene}}\n- 发送者：{{sender}}\n- 接收者：{{recipient}}\n\n要求：\n1. 内容要符合该卡片的风格和情境\n2. 语气要自然、有代入感\n3. 字数控制在100-300字之间\n\n请直接输出内容，不要有其他说明。",
  "style": {
    "theme": "retro-paper",
    "colors": [
      "#f5e6c8",
      "#8b6914",
      "#4a3728"
    ],
    "mood": "一条匿名树洞留言"
  },
  "rarity": "rare",
  "collectible": true
}